  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1747639065_9345881_fce755ea6ea4b8d934d9ef65547e89cf.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><strong>• Brand introduction:</strong></p><p data-start=\"96\" data-end=\"394\" id=\"isPasted\">Showitty is a U.S.-based fashion brand dedicated to empowering women through inclusive, confidence-boosting activewear. We believe every body is beautiful, and our mission is to deliver stylish, comfortable, and size-inclusive pieces that celebrate real women in motion.</p><p data-start=\"96\" data-end=\"394\"><br><strong>• Product description:</strong></p><p data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"657\" id=\"isPasted\">We specialize in high-waist workout shorts, buttery-soft leggings, and everyday essentials that blend function and fashion. Our designs focus on fit, comfort, and versatility — perfect for gym days, coffee runs, or lounging at home.</p><p data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"657\"><br><strong>• USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></p><p data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"731\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Inclusive sizing (from S to 3XL)</span></p><p data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"731\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Comfort-first, flattering designs</span></p><p data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"816\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Affordable without compromising on quality</span></p><p data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"865\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Loved by over 100k customers across the U.S.</span></p><p data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"902\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Viral hits on TikTok &amp; Instagram</span></p><p data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"902\"><br><strong>• Payment terms:</strong></p><p data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"1076\" id=\"isPasted\">Affiliates earn <strong data-start=\"943\" data-end=\"960\">8% commission</strong> on every referred sale. Commissions are paid <strong data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1017\">monthly</strong> via PayPal or bank transfer. 30-day cookie window applies.</p><p data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"1076\"><br><strong>• Other information:</strong></p><p data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1315\" id=\"isPasted\">We welcome influencers of all sizes and styles. Whether you’re a fitness creator, fashion blogger, or body positivity advocate, we’d love to collaborate! Free product gifting is available for selected creators.</p></div></div>",
